{% macro prescreen_and_prior(local_prescreen_issues, local_check_note, prior_issues) %}
{% set local_prescreen_issues = local_prescreen_issues | default([]) %}
{% set local_check_note = local_check_note | default('') %}
{% set prior_issues = prior_issues | default([]) %}
{% if local_prescreen_issues %}
## ⚡ Local Prescreening Issues
{% for issue in local_prescreen_issues %}
{{ loop.index }}. [{{ issue.issue_type | default('') }}] Confidence {{ ((issue.confidence | default(0)) * 100) | int }}%: {{ issue.summary | default('') }}
   Evidence: {{ issue.evidence | default('') }}
{% endfor %}
High-confidence issues (≥ 85%) can be confirmed directly; low-confidence issues need judgment combined with main text narrative logic.
{% if local_check_note %}{{ local_check_note }}{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if prior_issues %}
## ⚠️ Historical Issue Verification
The following issues have been submitted for fixes; determine one by one whether resolved:
{% for issue in prior_issues %}
{{ loop.index }}. [{{ issue.issue_type | default('') }}] ({{ issue.severity | default('') }}){% if issue.issue_id | default('') %} id={{ issue.issue_id }}{% endif %}{% if issue.repair_surface | default('') %} surface={{ issue.repair_surface }}{% endif %} — {{ issue.summary | default('') }}
   {% if issue.evidence | default('') %}Evidence: {{ issue.evidence }}{% endif %}
   {% if issue.repair_focus | default('') %}Repair Focus: {{ issue.repair_focus }}{% endif %}
   {% if issue.missing_anchors | default([]) %}
   Need to Anchor Back:
   {% for anchor in issue.missing_anchors | default([]) %}
   - {{ anchor.source | default('') }} / {{ anchor.role | default('') }}: {{ anchor.text | default('') }}
   {% endfor %}
   {% endif %}
   {% if issue.postconditions | default([]) %}
   Repair Acceptance Conditions:
   {% for condition in issue.postconditions | default([]) %}
   - [{{ condition.validator_id | default('') }}] {{ condition.description | default('') }}{% if condition.evidence_hint | default('') %} (Evidence Hint: {{ condition.evidence_hint }}){% endif %}
   {% endfor %}
   {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
Resolved issues are removed from issues; unresolved ones are retained with reasons. If a prior_issue remains unresolved, when outputting issues you must preserve its `issue_id`, and explain in evidence or diagnostic_note which postconditions were not met.
{% endif %}

{% if must_resolve_summaries | default([]) %}
## 🚨 Blocking Archive Issues·Item-by-Item Verification (Must Be Resolved)
The following are severe issues that may persist after multiple rounds of fixes; please verify item by item in the main text whether completely eliminated:
{% for summary in must_resolve_summaries | default([]) %}
- {{ summary }}
{% endfor %}
If any of the above still exists in the fixed main text, please report it in issues with its original severity (critical or high) as is, do not downgrade.
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
